      "topicNote": "Simultaneous equations. The tag is correct.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "title": "Solve simultaneous equations",
          "body": "\\[\n6x+4y=1\n\\]\n\n\\[\n3x+5y=8\n\\]"
        },
        {
          "title": "Double the second equation",
          "body": "Double the second equation:\n\\[\n6x+10y=16\n\\]"
