        },
        {
          "title": "Solve simultaneous equations",
          "body": "Substitute into \\(3x+5y=8\\):\n\\[\n3x+5\\left(\\frac52\\right)=8\n\\]\n\n\\[\n3x+\\frac{25}{2}=8\n\\]\n\n\\[\n3x=-\\frac92\n\\]\n\n\\[\nx=-\\frac32\n\\]"
        }
