          "body": "\\[\n\\vec{OA}=4\\mathbf a,\\qquad \\vec{OB}=3\\mathbf b,\\qquad \\vec{BC}=2\\mathbf a+\\mathbf b\n\\]"
        },
        {
          "title": "Read the graph",
          "body": "So\n\n\\[\n\\vec{OC}=\\vec{OB}+\\vec{BC}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\vec{OC}=2\\mathbf a+4\\mathbf b\n\\]"
