          "body": "\\[\n\\frac{30\\times 25^{2x+7}}{\\sqrt{180}\\times (\\sqrt{5})^{4x+9}}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\frac{30}{\\sqrt{180}}=\\frac{30}{6\\sqrt{5}}=\\sqrt{5}=5^{1/2}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n25^{2x+7}=(5^2)^{2x+7}=5^{4x+14}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n(\\sqrt{5})^{4x+9}=5^{2x+\\frac92}\n\\]"
